# .trivyignore
#
# CVEs accepted for the published fetchly image, consumed by the Trivy scan in
# .github/workflows/docker-build.yml. The scan already passes --ignore-unfixed,
# so every entry here is a finding that HAS a fix available and is accepted
# anyway. Each entry needs a reason and an `exp:` date, after which Trivy
# reports it again and forces a re-check.
#
# Format: `<id> exp:YYYY-MM-DD`, with the reason in a comment above it.
#
# No exceptions are currently accepted.
